Ticket #4471 merged 412 reports across 11 tenants as a single date issue. Closer analysis of the reports and tenant configurations reveals two distinct bugs rather than one:

1. **Parser bug (`parser`)**: 379 reports across 11 tenants. The shared date parser reads dates as month-first (`MM/DD/YYYY`). Day-first tenants (`DD/MM/YYYY`) have their days and months transposed when the day is 12 or less. Filed as **Ticket #1** in our repository.
2. **Form hint bug (`hint`)**: 33 reports across 3 tenants (`alder.physio`, `copper.studio`, `pale.harbour`). The `booking-v3` form displays an `MM/DD/YYYY` placeholder hint to people booking with day-first tenants, leading them to enter the month first. Filed as **Ticket #2** in our repository.

<Callout>
Split into two distinct tickets. 379 reports belong to the shared parser; 33 reports belong to the booking-v3 form hint.
</Callout>

## Reports breakdown

